        <h3>Merge Types</h3>
        <pre><code>Major merger: mass ratio < 1:3
Minor merger: mass ratio > 1:3
Dry merger: gas-poor, no star formation
Wet merger: gas-rich, starburst
Triggered star formation and AGN activity</code></pre>
